                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Located in the Sahyadri mountain range, Raigad was chosen by Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj to serve as the capital of the Maratha Empire. Its steep cliffs and single narrow pathway made it an impregnable citadel, perfectly suited to defend Swarajya. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " The fort witnessed the grand coronation of Shivaji Maharaj in 1674, marking the official establishment of a sovereign state. A marvel of engineering, the fort features the ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "Gangasagar Lake"
                      ]
                    },
                    ", an artificial lake built to provide a reliable water source for the capital's inhabitants, alongside majestic Darbars and the Samadhi of the great king. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " सह्याद्रीच्या पर्वतरांगांमध्ये वसलेला रायगड किल्ला छत्रपती शिवाजी महाराजांनी मराठा साम्राज्याची राजधानी म्हणून निवडला. किल्ल्याची दुर्गमता आणि सुरक्षितता याला स्वराज्याची राजधानी बनण्यास योग्य ठरली. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " १६७४ मध्ये याच किल्ल्यावर महाराजांचा भव्य राज्याभिषेक झाला. किल्ल्यावरील ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "गंगासागर तलाव"
                      ]
                    },
                    " हे जलव्यवस्थापनाचे एक उत्कृष्ट उदाहरण आहे. याच गडावर महाराजांची समाधी आणि राजदरबार आहे, जे आजही शिवभक्तांचे प्रमुख श्रद्धास्थान आहे. "
                  ]
                },
                " "
